<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Abercrombie &amp; Fitch raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Abercrombie &amp; Fitch raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs added Abercrombie &amp; Fitch Co to the recommended list from market outperform, market sources said Friday.</p>
<p>-- Abercrombie &amp; Fitch gained 1-7/8 to 16-1/8 in midday trading.</p>
<p>-- On Thursday, Abercrombie &amp; Fitch said it remained on track to meet analysts' fourth quarter earnings estimate of $0.39 a share.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
